<h2 class="fr-h4">Détails du dossier</h2>
<p>Retrouvez ici la déclaration de l'usager et les informations sur le logement, l'usager et le bailleur.</p>

<div class="fr-p-3w fr-frame--grey fr-mb-3w">
    <h3 class="fr-h5 title-blue-france">Déclaration de l'usager</h3>
    <p>La déclaration, les documents et les photos ajoutées par l'usager ne sont pas modifiables.</p>
    {% include 'back/signalement/view/user-declaration.html.twig' %}
</div>

<div class="fr-p-3w fr-frame--white fr-mb-3w">
    <div class="fr-grid-row fr-grid-row--middle fr-mb-3w">
        <img src="{{ asset('build/dsfr/artwork/pictograms/digital/avatar.svg') }}" aria-hidden="true" class="fr-artwork fr-mr-2w" alt="" width="48" height="48">
        <h3 class="fr-h5 title-blue-france fr-mb-0">Le foyer</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="fr-grid-row">
        <div class="fr-col-12 fr-col-md-6 fr-pr-6v" id="signalement-coordonnees-foyer-container">
            {% include 'back/signalement/view/details/coordonnees-foyer.html.twig' %}
        </div>

        <div class="fr-col-12 fr-col-md-6" id="signalement-coordonnees-tiers-container">
            {% include 'back/signalement/view/details/coordonnees-tiers.html.twig' %}
        </div>
    </div>
    <hr class="fr-mt-3w fr-hr">
    <div class="fr-grid-row">
        <div class="fr-col-12" id="signalement-situation-foyer-container">
            {% include 'back/signalement/view/details/situation-foyer.html.twig' %}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="signalement-bailleur-agence-syndic-container">
    {% include 'back/signalement/view/details/bailleur-agence-syndic.html.twig' %}
</div>

<div class="fr-p-3w fr-frame--white fr-mb-3w">
    <div class="fr-grid-row fr-grid-row--middle fr-mb-3w">
        <div class="fr-col-12 fr-col-md-8 fr-grid-row fr-grid-row--middle">
            <img src="{{ asset('build/dsfr/artwork/pictograms/digital/mail-send.svg') }}" aria-hidden="true" class="fr-artwork fr-mr-2w" alt="" width="48" height="48">
            <h3 class="fr-h5 title-blue-france fr-mb-0">Démarches entreprises par l'usager</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="fr-col-12 fr-col-md-4 fr-text--right">
            {% if is_granted('SIGN_EDIT_ACTIVE', signalement) %}
                <button class="fr-btn fr-btn--tertiary fr-btn--sm fr-btn--icon-left fr-icon-edit-line"
                    data-panel-open="panel-edit-procedure-demarches"
                    aria-controls="panel-edit-procedure-demarches"
                    data-fr-opened="false"
                    >Modifier</button>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="signalement-demarches-usager-container">
        {% include 'back/signalement/view/details/demarches-usager.html.twig' %}
    </div>
</div>

<div class="fr-p-3w fr-frame--white fr-mb-3w">
    <div class="fr-grid-row fr-grid-row--middle fr-mb-3w">
        <img src="{{ asset('img/picto-dsfr/logement.svg') }}" aria-hidden="true" class="fr-artwork fr-mr-2w" alt="" width="48" height="48">
        <h3 class="fr-h5 title-blue-france fr-mb-0">Le logement</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="fr-grid-row">
        <div class="fr-col-12 fr-col-md-6 fr-pr-6v" id="signalement-description-logement-container">
            {% include 'back/signalement/view/details/description-logement.html.twig' %}
        </div>

        <div class="fr-col-12 fr-col-md-6" id="signalement-occupation-logement-container">
            {% include 'back/signalement/view/details/occupation-logement.html.twig' %}
        </div>
    </div>
    <hr class="fr-mt-3w fr-hr">
    <div class="fr-grid-row">
        <div class="fr-col-12" id="signalement-consommation-energetique-container">
            {% include 'back/signalement/view/details/consommation-energetique.html.twig' %}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>